> +#
> +# Example:
> +# /**
> +#  * user_function - function that can only be called in user context
> +#  * @a: some argument
> +#  * Context: !in_interrupt()
> +#  *
> +#  * Some description
> +#  * Example:
> +#  *    user_function(22);
> +#  */
> +# ...
> +#
